# `RELEASE_ID` is a placeholder (`$Format:%H$`) that `git archive`
# substitutes with the real commit SHA at archive time — the mechanism
# `ops/identity.py` relies on for a non-forgeable release identity
# (ADR-019). A plain checkout never substitutes it, so a dev tree can
# never impersonate an archived release. See ops/identity.py's module
# docstring.
RELEASE_ID export-subst
